xtAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Hot keys & the two-tier design", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e758", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 15446.0, "width": 1254.0, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1016756317, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 420296545, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011375077, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "At 300k ops/sec, one whale tenant can drive a single Redis shard to saturation on its own. This section is where the interview goes when it's going well.", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "At 300k ops/sec, one whale tenant can drive a single Redis shard to saturation on its own. This section is where the interview goes when it's going well.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e759", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 15496.5, "width": 280.5, "height": 27.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 800398061, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1162924751, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011375077, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Three problems, three fixes", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Three problems, three fixes", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e760", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 15538.5, "width": 733, "height": 111.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#f59e0b", "backgroundColor": "#fff3bf", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g139"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1974624995, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 958523967, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011375077, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e761", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 15552.5, "width": 65.7, "height": 17.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#b45309", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g139"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 414520586, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 694301198, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011375077, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "HOT KEY", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "HOT KEY", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e762", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 15576.0, "width": 699.3, "height": 60.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g139"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 782218472, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1583382221, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011375077, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "One identity's key lives on one shard, so its whole load hits one core. Fix: shard the counter\nitself into N sub-counters and limit each to limit/N (approximate but distributes), or promote that\nkey to a local-tier bucket.", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "One identity's key lives on one shard, so its whole load hits one core. Fix: shard the counter\nitself into N sub-counters and limit each to limit/N (approximate but distributes), or promote that\nkey to a local-tier bucket.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e763", "type": "rectangle", "x": 833, "y": 15538.5, "width": 733, "height": 111.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#f59e0b", "backgroundColor": "#fff3bf", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g140"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1926278589, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1019054749, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011375077, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e764", "type": "text", "x": 847, "y": 15552.5, "width": 137.6, "height": 17.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#b45309", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g140"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 65030223, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1356484092, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011375077, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "ROUND-TRIP COST", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "ROUND-TRIP COST", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e765", "type": "text", "x": 847, "y": 15576.0, "width": 680.8, "height": 40.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g140"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 882190216, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 532603958, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011375077, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Every request pays 0.5 ms x number of rules. Fix: batched borrow - a node claims a block of\npermits at once and spends them locally.", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Every request pays 0.5 ms x number of rules. Fix: batched borrow - a node claims a block of\npermits at once and spends them locally.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e766", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1606, "y": 15538.5, "width": 733, "height": 111.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#f59e0b", "backgroundColor": "#fff3bf", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g141"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1743379899, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1343054110, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011375077, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e767", "type": "text", "x": 1620, "y": 15552.5, "width": 192.7, "height": 17.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#b45309", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g141"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1646407000, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 869242576, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011375077, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "KNOWN-BLOCKED REPLAY", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "KNOWN-BLOCKED REPLAY", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e768", "type": "text", "x": 1620, "y": 15576.0, "width": 685.5, "height": 40.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g141"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 87294111, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 806525423, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011375077, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "A client being throttled retries hardest, so denied requests are the majority of load. Fix: cache\nthe denial locally until retryAfter and short-circuit with zero Redis calls.", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "A client being throttled retries hardest, so denied requests are the majority of load. Fix: cache\nthe denial locally until retryAfter and short-circuit with zero Redis calls.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e769", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 15690.0, "width": 812.1, "height": 27.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 74849230, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 996541114, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011375077, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "The two-tier request flow: L1 local negative cache + batched borrow -> L2 Redis", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "The two-tier request flow: L1 local negative cache + batched borrow -> L2 Redis", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e770", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 15734.0, "width": 2280, "height": 960, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#adb5bd", "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "dashed", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g142"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 134389399, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1725155388, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011375077, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e771", "type": "rectangle", "x": 80, "y": 15754.0, "width": 2240, "height": 690, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#12b886", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "dashed", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1975849727, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 133152356, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011375077, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e772", "type": "text", "x": 100, "y": 15766.0, "width": 875.8, "height": 21.2, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#0b7285", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 551937566, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 418633577, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011375077, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "GATEWAY NODE - L1: in-process LRU of { permits, blockedUntil, limit } per key (up to 100k keys), zero network", "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "GATEWAY NODE - L1: in-process LRU of { permits, blockedUntil, limit } per key (up to 100k keys), zero network", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e773", "type": "rectangle", "x": 110, "y": 15824.0, "width": 240, "height": 120, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a9eed", "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g143"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1604786199, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 134973078, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"id": "e812", "type": "arrow"}], "updated": 1792011375077, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e774", "type": "text", "x": 120, "y": 15859.1, "width": 220, "height": 23.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g143"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1929625277, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1300551083, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011375077, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "consume(key, rule, cost)", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalT