: "\"Data plane stays one round trip. Rules are pushed, metrics are async.\"", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "\"Data plane stays one round trip. Rules are pushed, metrics are async.\"", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e1072", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 23650.5, "width": 2280, "height": 36.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#adb5bd", "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g195"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1923162783, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 102598964, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011375077, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e1073", "type": "text", "x": 69, "y": 23659.5, "width": 41.9, "height": 18.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#0b7285", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g195"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 283517865, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1048819206, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011375077, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "14-20", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "14-20", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e1074", "type": "text", "x": 219, "y": 23659.5, "width": 616.8, "height": 18.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g195"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 488036358, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1315375467, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011375077, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Compare algorithms in a table. Name the fixed-window boundary flaw. Pick token bucket.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Compare algorithms in a table. Name the fixed-window boundary flaw. Pick token bucket.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e1075", "type": "text", "x": 1219, "y": 23659.5, "width": 613.2, "height": 18.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g195"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1402539673, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 97890256, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011375077, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "\"Token bucket, because burst tolerance is an explicit parameter rather than an accident.\"", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "\"Token bucket, because burst tolerance is an explicit parameter rather than an accident.\"", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e1076", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 23687.2, "width": 2280, "height": 36.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#adb5bd", "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g195"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 47866387, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 116808155, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011375077, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e1077", "type": "text", "x": 69, "y": 23696.2, "width": 41.9, "height": 18.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#0b7285", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g195"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 5616733, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1217883425, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011375077, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "20-30", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "20-30", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e1078", "type": "text", "x": 219, "y": 23696.2, "width": 686.0, "height": 18.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g195"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 762276326, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 652274068, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011375077, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "LLD: the Strategy interface, the Rule, the Store port, the composite chain. Then code the algorithm.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "LLD: the Strategy interface, the Rule, the Store port, the composite chain. Then code the algorithm.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e1079", "type": "text", "x": 1219, "y": 23696.2, "width": 520.4, "height": 18.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g195"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 228412063, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1123324559, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011375077, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "\"One interface, five implementations, algorithm chosen per rule at runtime.\"", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "\"One interface, five implementations, algorithm chosen per rule at runtime.\"", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e1080", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 23724.0, "width": 2280, "height": 36.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#adb5bd", "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g195"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 766977113, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1146999180, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011375077, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e1081", "type": "text", "x": 69, "y": 23733.0, "width": 41.9, "height": 18.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#0b7285", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g195"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 481592461, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 887422841, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011375077, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "30-36", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "30-36", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e1082", "type": "text", "x": 219, "y": 23733.0, "width": 329.5, "height": 18.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g195"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1253251956, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 646725408, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011375077, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Write the Lua. Explain why atomicity requires it.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Write the Lua. Explain why atomicity requires it.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e1083", "type": "text", "x": 1219, "y": 23733.0, "width": 518.4, "height": 18.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g195"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1265064595, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 287175924, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011375077, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "\"GET-then-SET from the app is a race. Lua runs it server-side in one step.\"", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "\"GET-then-SET from the app is a race. Lua runs it server-side in one step.\"", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e1084", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 23760.8, "width": 2280, "height": 36.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#adb5bd", "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g195"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 438482606, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 786482664, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011375077, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e1085", "type": "text", "x": 69, "y": 23769.8, "width": 41.9, "height": 18.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#0b7285", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g195"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1339878524, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1779129429, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011375077, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "36-42", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "36-42", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e1086", "type": "text", "x": 219, "y": 23769.8, "width": 415.2, "height": 18.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g195"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1019843881, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 340641237, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011375077, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Failure + scale: circuit breaker, fail-open, hot keys, local tier.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Failure + scale: circuit breaker, fail-open, hot keys, local tier.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e1087", "type": "text", "x": 1219, "y": 23769.8, "width": 383.4, "height": 18.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g195"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 289370629, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 30305330, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011375077, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "\"The limiter must never be the reason the API is down.\"", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "\"The limiter must never be the reason the API is down.\"", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e1088", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 23797.5, "width": 2280, "height": 36.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#adb5bd", "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g195"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 2011313669, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1721214107, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011375077, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e1089", "type": "text", "x": 69, "y": 23806.5, "width": 41.9, "height": 18.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#0b7285", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g195"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 523101812, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1519285880, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011375077, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "42-45", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "42-45", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e1090", "type": "text", "x": 219, "y": 23806.5, "width": 406.5, "height": 18.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g195"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 320647401, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 968199666, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011375077, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Trade-offs you knowingly made, and what you'd build next.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Trade-offs you knowingly made, and what you'd build next.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e1091", "type": "text", "x": 1219, "y": 23806.5, "width": 688.2, "height": 18.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g195"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 205738974, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 136727366, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011375077, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "\"I chose bounded over-admission on failover. If we needed a hard cap, that's a ledger, not a limiter.\"", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "\"I chose bounded over-admission on failover. If we needed a hard cap, that's a ledger, not a limiter.\"", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e1092", "type": "line", "x": 210, "y": 23506.8, "width": 0, "height": 327.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#adb5bd", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g195"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1370545746, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 310722898, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011375077, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[0, 0.0], [0, 327.5]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": null}, {"id": "e1093", "type": "line", "x": 1210, "y": 23506.8, "width": 0, "height": 327.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#adb5bd", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g195"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1871071581, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1429091340, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011375077, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[0, 0.0], [0, 327.5]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": null}, {"id": "e1094", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 23874.2, "width": 1120, "height": 159.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a9eed", "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g196"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1679667509, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 579305494, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011375077, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e1095", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 23888.2, "width": 328.1, "height": 25.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g196"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 863187255, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1742834433, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011375077, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Five sentences that carry the round", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Five sentences that carry the round", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e1096", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 23919.2, "width": 1077.8, "height": 100.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g196"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 567450723, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2076907458, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011375077, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "1.  \"Rate limiting is a distributed counter with a time dimension - every decision here trades accuracy against coordination cost.\"\n2.  \"Fixed window allows 2x the limit across a window boundary; that's why I'd default to token bucket or sliding counter.\"\n3.  \"Read-modify-write from the application is a race - the counter update has to be atomic, which is why the logic lives in Lua.\"\n4.  \"I'd fail open. A limiter outage must not become an API outage - except on endpoints where exceeding the limit costs money.\"\n5.  \"Redis replication is async, so a failover can over-admit briefly. That's acceptable soft state with a stated SLO; a hard cap is a different system.\"", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "1.  \"Rate limiting is a distributed counter with a time dimension - every decision here trades accuracy against coordination cost.\"\n2.  \"Fixed window allows 2x the limit across a window boundary; that's why I'd default to token bucket or sliding counter.\"\n3.  \"Read-modify-write from the application is a race - the counter update has to be atomic, which is why the logic lives in Lua.\"\n4.  \"I'd fail open. A limiter outage must not become an API outage - except on endpoints where exceeding the limit costs money.\"\n5.  \"Redis replication is async, so a failover can over-admit briefly. That's acceptable soft state with a stated SLO; a hard cap is a different system.\"", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e1097", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1220, "y": 23874.2, "width": 1120, "height": 111.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#22c55e", "backgroundColor": "#d3f9d8", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g197"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 24687568, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 120539463, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011375077, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e1098", "type": "text", "x": 1234, "y": 23888.2, "width": 291.8, "height": 17.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#15803d", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g197"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1385013920, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1762827844, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011375077, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "IF THEY SAY \"NOW MAKE IT 10X BIGGER\"", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "IF THEY SAY \"NOW MAKE IT 10X BIGGER\"", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e1099", "type": "text", "x": 1234, "y": 23911.8, "width": 1086.6, "height": 60.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g197"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1207597002, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1917008319, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011375077, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Go to section 07 in this order: negative-cache the denials (removes the majority of traffic on an abused key), batch the borrow (removes most round\ntrips), then shard the hot key (removes the last hot spot). Quantify each one - \"the negative cache alone drops Redis load by the deny ratio, which\nunder attack is most of it.\"", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Go to section 07 in this order: negative-cache the denials (removes the majority of traffic on an abused key), batch the borrow (removes most round\ntrips), then shard the hot key (removes the last hot spot). Quantify each one - \"the negative cache alone drops Redis load by the deny ratio, which\nunder attack is most of it.\"", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e1101", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 24113.2, "width": 1050.4, "height": 20.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1386424247, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1242260233, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1792011375077, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Rate Limiter Interview Kit - JavaScript - Node + Redis. All code here is illustrative and written to be explained aloud, not pasted into production.", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Rate Limiter Interview Kit - JavaScript - Node + Redis. All code here is illustrative and written to be explained aloud, not pasted into production.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}], "appState": {"gridSize": null, "viewBackgroundColor": "#ffffff"}, "files": {}}